wback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Loyalty (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Offerings (7 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Poverty (10 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Ritual (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Secrecy (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Silence (2 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Wardenship (3 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of the Cryptkeeper (1 drawback point)	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Casting Boon|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS|1	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Spheres Oath Adjudication,Reviewed - Oath of Abstention	DESC:Grants 1 drawback point (counts as 1 drawbacks and costs none). Oath: You cut excess pleasures from your consumption, surviving on only the bare necessities. You may not consume any but the most basic food and drink, meaning that you cannot consume drugs, potions, alchemical formulae, or other beneficial items that must be consumed to gain their effects. You may not consume any food or drink worth more than 1 gp. Defiance Penalty: The introduction of exotic foodstuffs into your system works against you, causing you to take a penalty on all Fortitude saves equal to half your character level [minimum 1]. Atonement: You must fast for five days, during which time you may not eat anything. This may cause you to take nonlethal damage from starvation as normal. Breaking, forsaking, or lacking this oath suspends spellcasting until atonement or a new 8-hour oath.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/oaths#toc8
Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Burdens (1 drawback point)	CATEGORY:Custom Casting Drawback	COST:0	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Forbidden Knowledge (greater severance) (4 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Forbidden Knowledge (lesser severance) (2 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath against Artifice (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath against Harm (4 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath against Magic (3 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath against Mercy (2 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Abstention (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Candor (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Celibacy (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Deliberation (4 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Devotion (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Expedience (3 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Honor (2 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Humility (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Ignorance (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Loyalty (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Offerings (7 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Poverty (10 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Ritual (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Secrecy (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Silence (2 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Wardenship (3 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of the Cryptkeeper (1 drawback point)	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Casting Boon|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS|1	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Spheres Oath Adjudication,Reviewed - Oath of Burdens	DESC:Grants 1 drawback point (counts as 1 drawbacks and costs none). Oath: You have taken up some great physical burden or mutilation which will weigh on you at all times. You must carry weights or alter your body such that you are always encumbered by at least a medium load, taking encumbrance penalties as normal. Defiance Penalty: Removing your burden creates an unfamiliar, unstable sensation, causing you to take a penalty on Reflex saves equal to half your character level [minimum 1]. Atonement: In addition to taking up the physical burden again for at least one day, you must perform some great physical feat while carrying your burden. This may be climbing a mountain, swimming across or river, or performing some other physically taxing feat. Breaking, forsaking, or lacking this oath suspends spellcasting until atonement or a new 8-hour oath.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/oaths#toc9
Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Candor (1 drawback point)	CATEGORY:Custom Casting Drawback	COST:0	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Forbidden Knowledge (greater severance) (4 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Forbidden Knowledge (lesser severance) (2 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath against Artifice (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath against Harm (4 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath against Magic (3 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath against Mercy (2 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Abstention (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Burdens (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Celibacy (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Deliberation (4 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Devotion (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Expedience (3 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Honor (2 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Humility (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Ignorance (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Loyalty (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Offerings (7 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Poverty (10 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Ritual (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Secrecy (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Silence (2 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Wardenship (3 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of the Cryptkeeper (1 drawback point)	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Casting Boon|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS|1	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Spheres Oath Adjudication,Reviewed - Oath of Candor	DESC:Grants 1 drawback point (counts as 1 drawbacks and costs none). Oath: Your words will betray no falsehood. You are not allowed to deliberately speak any lies, including bluffing, stating half-truths or concealed truths with the intent to deceive, exaggerating, telling white lies, and so on. This applies to all forms of communication. If presented with circumstances where telling the truth would bring harm, you can remain silent. Defiance Penalty: Your broken Oath visits its wrath upon you by muddling truth and lie, causing you to take a penalty on all Charisma-based, Intelligence-based, and Wisdom-based rolls as well magic skill checks and saving throws equal to half your character level [minimum 1]. Atonement: Atonement for breaking your Oath requires you to attempt to correct any falsehoods that your words might have spread. Alternatively, you may donate your wealth to some cause as an offering and assurance that you will not again go against your word. The total value of donated materials must be worth at least 100 gp x your character level squared. Breaking, forsaking, or lacking this oath suspends spellcasting until atonement or a new 8-hour oath.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/oaths#toc10
Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Celibacy (1 drawback point)	CATEGORY:Custom Casting Drawback	COST:0	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Forbidden Knowledge (greater severance) (4 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Forbidden Knowledge (lesser severance) (2 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath against Artifice (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath against Harm (4 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath against Magic (3 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath against Mercy (2 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Abstention (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Burdens (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Candor (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Deliberation (4 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Devotion (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Expedience (3 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Honor (2 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Humility (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Ignorance (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Loyalty (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Offerings (7 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Poverty (10 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Ritual (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Secrecy (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Silence (2 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Wardenship (3 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of the Cryptkeeper (1 drawback point)	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Casting Boon|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS|1	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Spheres Oath Adjudication,Reviewed - Oath of Celibacy	DESC:Grants 1 drawback point (counts as 1 drawbacks and costs none). Oath: You have vowed to abstain from all intimacy with others, refusing to form romantic or sexual attachments with others. You cannot express any non-platonic love to others in any form, and cannot willingly benefit from morale bonuses granted by other characters or from the aid another action. In addition, you cannot perform the aid another action to benefit other people. Defiance Penalty: Should you succumb to your emotions, you are wracked with internal doubt. You take a penalty equal to half your character level on all concentration checks and initiative checks [minimum 1]. Atonement: You must once again forswear your attachments to others, spending 3 days in selfless service to a cause or community during which you purge yourself of hedonistic desires or ambitions to control others. You must also donate or destroy valuables or keepsakes worth at least 100 gp x your character level squared. Breaking, forsaking, or lacking this oath suspends spellcasting until atonement or a new 8-hour oath.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/oaths#toc11
