wback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Loyalty (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Offerings (7 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Poverty (10 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Ritual (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Secrecy (1 drawback point)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Silence (2 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of Wardenship (3 drawback points)	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Oathbound Casting: Oath of the Cryptkeeper (1 drawback point)	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Casting Boon|4	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS|4	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Spheres Oath Adjudication,Reviewed - Oath of Deliberation	DESC:Grants 4 drawback points (counts as 4 drawbacks and costs none). Source: Baron's Otherworldly Citadel Oath: You have promised to carry yourself with weighted patience. You cannot willingly perform swift or immediate actions. Defiance Penalty: The tension of reckless action disrupts your equilibrium, causing you to take a penalty on attack rolls and AC equal to half your character level [minimum -2]. Atonement: You must redevelop your patience in tense situations, acting as if you had the staggered condition for 24 hours. Breaking, forsaking, or lacking this oath suspends spellcasting until atonement or a new 8-hour oath.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/oaths#toc13
